The files in this repository come from two sources.

    internal-test/
        Pixel tests written for Starfish (Copyright Samsung Electronics
        Co., Ltd.). They are part of Starfish and are distributed under the
        same terms as Starfish itself; see the COPYRIGHT and LICENSE.* files
        at the root of the Starfish repository.

    cdp/inspector-protocol/
        third_party/blink/web_tests/http/tests/inspector-protocol
        from chromium/chromium, imported without modification
        https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src
        Pinned revision: cdp/inspector-protocol/revision.txt
        Distributed under the 3-clause BSD licence reproduced below.

